                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The original developer sold it to other people who was very enthusiastic at the beginning but soon lost their momentum. Now it is completely abandoned: no news, no updates, no game, actually.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1621597184,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1621597184,
